entries[311441] = { ["name"] = "Darkmoon Card of Death", ["text"] = "2.5 sec cast\nTools: Virtuoso Inking Set\nReagents:\nLuminous Ink (7), Umbral Ink (7), Tranquil Ink , Dark Parchment\nCraft a random Darkmoon Card from the Indomitable, Voracity, Putrescence, or Repose sets. Occasionally make a blank card that can be used to make a random card from a specific set.\nProfession:\nShadowlands Inscription (80)\nTrainer:\nScribe Au'tehshi\nZone:\nOribos\nCost:\n4\n\nDarkmoon Card of Death\n\"A random Darkmoon Card of Death. Collect a full set to receive a reward.\"" }
